OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to police
OL,4,Apursuit crash victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family have said they are "completely
OL,7,Fdevastated", after their 23-year-old
OL,8,Fdaughter was killed in a crash in
OL,9,FLeeds.
OL,11,FJade Langton and Cameron Bell, from
OL,12,FYork, had been travelling along Gelderd
OL,13,FRoad when a blue BMW 123D, that had
OL,14,Ffailed to stop for police, crashed into
OL,15,Fthem at 00:44 GMT on Sunday.
OL,17,FWest Yorkshire Police confirmed
OL,18,FCameron, 22, died at the scene and his
OL,19,Fpassenger, Jade, died in hospital
OL,20,Fshortly after.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
