OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to police
OL,4,Apursuit crash victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Jade's family said:
OL,7,F"Whilst she always loved a bit of
OL,8,Fdrama, Jade did not deserve to have her
OL,9,Flife cut short in this way."
